  "reason": "The title and abstract discuss the history and future of safety pharmacology, including its regulatory context and scientific evolution. However, it does not report any quantitative measures of agreement between non-human animal results and human clinical results, nor does it present a systematic comparison of animal vs. human effect sizes. It is a narrative review of the field, not an analysis of concordance."
